(c)Toy instruments or apparatus (heading 9503.00);

(d)Brushes for cleaning musical instruments (heading 96.03), or monopods, bipods, tripods and similar articles (hcading 96.20); or 



(e)Collectors' pieces or antiques (heading 97.05 or 97.06).

